# Practice questions

## Runtime

- Catalog UI reads static `$lib/data/exams.ts`. Domain names/weights: `$lib/catalog/trackDocSources.ts` — question `domain` tags must match `domains[].name` exactly
- Session UI: `/exams/[slug]/practice`. Client helpers in `$lib/practice/` (timer, shuffle, draft, keyboard)
- Load questions via Convex `listByTrackCode` (sample public ≤3; full = admin + `sessionSeed`)
- Submit via **`POST /api/practice/grade`** (Upstash IP rate limit) → `gradeAnswers`. Do not grade in the browser with leaked keys
- List payloads omit `correctIndex` / explanations. Keep it that way

## Private bank

| Path | Git | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `src/convex/seed/devQuestionBank.ts` | tracked | loader + `isFullQuestionBank()` (≥400 rows) |
| `src/convex/seed/devQuestionBank.private.ts` | **gitignored** | full prompts/answers |
| `src/convex/seed/devQuestionBank.private.example.ts` | tracked | one-row stub |

`npm prepare` copies the stub when the private file is missing. `npm run seed:dev:questions` **refuses** if only the stub is loaded (prevents wiping Convex).

## Authoring

Use `.cursor/skills/servicenow-exam-question-gen/SKILL.md` and `docs/agent-prompts/certification-questions.md`.

- Ground in [ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs](https://github.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs) markdown (`australia` family). Never scrape servicenow.com/docs
- Never copy Pearson VUE / confidential exams / brain dumps
- Realism tests: `src/convex/seed/*-realism.test.ts` (skip when the stub bank is tiny)

## Do not

- Commit the private bank or put answer keys in `$lib/data`
- Seed production with the stub
- Change official domain strings in one file only — keep `trackDocSources.ts` and seed `domain` fields in sync
